OL,3,AMinister refuses to rule out some young
OL,4,Apeople may lose benefits after Milburn
OL,5,Areview
OL,6,
OL,7,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,8,FMcFadden refuses to rule out some young
OL,9,Fpeople losing benefits ahead of the
OL,10,Frelease of a report into young people
OL,11,Fnot in education, employment or
OL,12,Ftraining (Neets)
OL,14,F"We need a complete reset of the system
OL,15,Fin terms of what it offers young
OL,16,Fpeople," he tells Laura Kuenssberg,
OL,17,Fadding: "Benefits are not guaranteed
OL,18,Ffor life"
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
